OL,3,GNEWSADisruption after 400 litre lorry
OL,4,Afuel leak on road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road has shut in Stoke-in-Trent after
OL,7,Fa lorry leaked around 400 litres of
OL,8,Ffuel onto the road.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Longton on
OL,11,FSaturday morning, where the spillage
OL,12,Fstretches on Anchor Road from Bambury
OL,13,FStreet to the Army Reserves Centre.
OL,15,FStaffordshire Police said it was
OL,16,Fworking with the fire service and
OL,17,Fhighways to clear the road surface -
OL,18,Fwhich is expected to take a "many"
OL,19,Fhours.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
